      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is true that such actions and remarks have occurred in the past.\n\nHowever, those actions were confined to specific locations or worlds, and the remarks were often difficult to hear from a distance or impossible to understand if spoken in a different language.\n\nWhen considering the current design, the key difference is that it allows for behavior that is offensive regardless of location or audience—no matter where you are, it can be perceived as rude.\n\nFurthermore, I do not believe that the fact that this behavior is similar to what is currently happening justifies overlooking a design that enables such misconduct.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
