  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think the addition of accessories is a great idea. It’s a real lifesaver, especially for users who don’t own a computer.\n\nHowever, there is a potential issue here: third-party accessories could lead to reputational damage for both the avatars and their creators.\n\nTherefore, how about adding a setting when uploading a public avatar that says, “Prevent this avatar from wearing accessories”? (Personally, I think the default setting should be off.)\n\nI believe this would help protect the creators’ brands and their public reputation.",
